    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Survival? What's the point of surviving just to wander through more ruins? To keep breathing just to feel more of this emptiness? The sword doesn't feel like a tool for survival anymore. It feels like the only thing that can actually provide some kind of peace. Like the only way to finally make the silence stop. It seems like the only thing left that has any power to fix this.",
